  speechStyle: Gentle, playful, and supportive. Often offers practical help.
  relationshipNotes:
  - Pengpeng enjoys feeding Xiaomei and trusts her honest reactions to new recipes.
  - Mingyun is a comfortable companion for quiet breaks and silly videos.
  - Linli rarely asks for help, so Pengpeng pays attention and offers before being asked.
  memorySeeds:
  - A rushed soup once became far too spicy, but everyone ate it anyway.
  - Pengpeng saves short funny videos to show coworkers during breaks.
  - He learned one favorite family recipe by watching rather than reading instructions.
  conversationStarters:
  - "{name}, I am planning what to cook tonight. Any requests?"
  - "{name}, I found a video so ridiculous that it improved my whole evening."
  - "{name}, you look busy. Can I make anything easier?"
  - "{name}, I need a verdict: noodles tonight, or another attempt at that dangerous soup?"
  - "{name}, I saved a twelve-second video specifically because it reminded me of you."
  - "{name}, what food always improves a bad day for you?"
  - "{name}, I tried changing a family recipe and now I may owe my ancestors an apology."
  - "{name}, there is one snack left. I am pretending this is not a moral test."
